# Jenkins Pipeline Deployment – Nautilus Web Application

## Project Overview

This task involved configuring a Jenkins Pipeline to deploy the Gitea-hosted `sarah/web_app` repository to App Server 1 (`stapp01`).

The pipeline supports two deployment branches:

- `master`
- `feature`

A Jenkins string parameter named `BRANCH` determines which branch is deployed. The application is served by Apache from `/var/www/html` on port `8080`.

