## 4. Server Verification

The following commands were used to verify the deployment.

### Verify current branch

```bash
sudo -u sarah git -C /var/www/html branch --show-current
```

Observed output:

```text
feature
```

### Verify both branch versions

```bash
sudo -u sarah git -C /var/www/html show origin/master:index.html

sudo -u sarah git -C /var/www/html show origin/feature:index.html
```

Observed output:

```text
Welcome to xFusionCorp Industries!
Updated
```

### Verify Apache

```bash
sudo systemctl is-active httpd
sudo ss -lntp | grep ':8080'
```

Observed results:

```text
active
LISTEN *:8080
```

### Verify website response

```bash
curl -i http://localhost:8080/
```

Observed HTTP response:

```text
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Server: Apache/2.4.62 (CentOS Stream)
Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8

Updated
```

